      "content": "4. Köppen Climate Classification – The Most Important System"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Developed by Wladimir Köppen, this system links climate with natural vegetation. It is the MOST widely used classification in competitive exams because it is objective and data-based.",
