      "level": 2,
      "content": "10. Thornthwaite Classification (Conceptual)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Thornthwaite classified climates based on moisture availability using the precipitation effectiveness index (PE). It focuses more on water balance than temperature.",
      "id": "dbptsal"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "• Humid climates – water surplus.",
      "id": "vcvexl0"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "• Arid climates – water deficit.",
      "id": "ua1heul"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "• Useful for agricultural planning.",
      "id": "y41p2fn"
    },
